# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and must stay that way.
#
# A personal access token with the read:user scope. Only needed to count
# private contributions: without it the meadow draws the public view, which
# here is roughly two thirds of the real total. In Actions this comes from a
# repository secret of the same name instead.
#
# Simpler alternative that needs no token at all: turn on
# "Include private contributions on my profile" in GitHub profile settings.
GH_TOKEN=
